Bosch eXchange provides remanufactured parts at significant cost savings versus new, meeting identical OEM quality standards through strict functional testing. Components undergo full functional and cosmetic inspection, enabling vehicle repairs proportionate to vehicle residual value. eXchange program combines series-remanufactured products with new parts to ensure market coverage and delivery capacity. This positioning remanufacturing as economically rational choice for repair technicians, extending vehicle economic lifespan and delaying scrap decisions.